sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State: Authorized
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State: EVConnectedPreSession

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEVChargingNeedsRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, maxScheduleTuples & chargingNeeds = <Configured values from mock EV>)
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEVChargingNeedsResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status Accepted

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId <Configured evseId><br>chargingProfilePurpose TxProfile<br>transactionId <Provided transactionId from before>
    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, chargingSchedule = <ChargingSchedule that exceeds the limits of the chargingSchedule provided at step 3>)
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status Rejected

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = ChargingStateChanged, transactionInfo.chargingState = Charging)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId <Configured evseId><br>chargingProfilePurpose TxProfile<br>transactionId <Provided transactionId from before>
    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, chargingSchedule = <ChargingSchedule provided at step 9>)
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
